        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Weakening Strike"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The target must succeed at a 20 Fortitude save or become enfeebled 1 (or enfeebled 2 on a critical hit) for 1 round.\n\nLone exiles of yeti clans have little use for treasure and leave the gear of their slain victims behind where it is quickly covered by snowfall. Clan-based yetis, on the other hand, create beautifully carved stonework, some of which they shape into protective talismans of rare beauty."
            },
